Package: argon-wfplug-batt
Version: 1.2.5
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: wf-panel-pi, wfplug-batt
Description: Enhanced Battery Telemetry Widget for Raspberry Pi OS (wf-panel-pi)
 Drop-in replacement for the standard wf-panel-pi battery plugin (libbatt.so)
 on Raspberry Pi OS (rpd-labwc / Wayfire).
 Dynamically reads and displays all available Linux /sys/class/power_supply/BAT*
 telemetry attributes on mouseover in a structured order (status, remaining
 runtime, power in Watts, current in Amps, voltage + design bounds, capacity
 in Wh/mAh, health %, cycle count, temperature, and battery model/technology),
 automatically hiding any unsupported fields. Also fixes upstream Cairo surface
 memory leaks.
